The player binary is built from sendspin-go (https://github.com/Sendspin/sendspin-go),
Copyright the Sendspin authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
This project adds an output backend (player/shelby.go) and a small patch to its
main package (player/main-shelby-output.patch).

The release zip contains no files from the speaker's manufacturer. The scripts
use the codec configuration files that are already present on the speaker.

